{"4304880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Superalignment", "steam_appid": 4304880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Superalignment</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror extraction game. You are hired by the Space Power Corporation to restore humanity's access to electricity. It is up to your survival skills whether you can complete the contract or become another write off for the company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Coordinate or Crumble</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work as a team to scout routes, share resources, and distract enemies. Coordination is the difference between hitting a massive jackpot and leaving the station empty handed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.poster.avif?t=1785578407\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.webm?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.mp4?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy gear to improve your odds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend your hard earned credits on gear and tools to ensure that next time, everyone makes it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.poster.avif?t=1785578407\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.webm?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.mp4?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>High Stakes Contract System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Select your mission from a rotating list of available contracts, each tied to 1 of 5 distinct, procedurally generated maps. Every contract defines your specific objectives, such as retrieving a set number of energy cells, penalties, and payout. Looking for a bigger challenge? Choose contracts with a higher recommended player </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modify Your Risk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The standard payout not enough? Add custom modifiers to your contract to increase the stakes. Increase enemy damage, incur a higher penalty per casualty, or disable oxygen tank spawning to multiply your earnings. You decide exactly how dangerous your shift will be, and exactly how much you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Navigate Hostile, Abandoned Stations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each map is overrun by rogue robots. With a variety of enemy robots, it is up to you to learn their behavior and strategize. A single mistake can be the deciding factor between completing and failing the contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Get in. Secure the cells. Get paid.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Superalignment</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror extraction game. You are hired by the Space Power Corporation to restore humanity's access to electricity. It is up to your survival skills whether you can complete the contract or become another write off for the company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Coordinate or Crumble</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work as a team to scout routes, share resources, and distract enemies. Coordination is the difference between hitting a massive jackpot and leaving the station empty handed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.poster.avif?t=1785578407\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.webm?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/3eec380a2eca2be6483c34018c6a6e84.mp4?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Buy gear to improve your odds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend your hard earned credits on gear and tools to ensure that next time, everyone makes it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.poster.avif?t=1785578407\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.webm?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304880/extras/bc7d0ffc2e90fadf826c56884f75b0f8.mp4?t=1785578407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>High Stakes Contract System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Select your mission from a rotating list of available contracts, each tied to 1 of 5 distinct, procedurally generated maps. Every contract defines your specific objectives, such as retrieving a set number of energy cells, penalties, and payout. Looking for a bigger challenge? Choose contracts with a higher recommended player </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modify Your Risk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The standard payout not enough? Add custom modifiers to your contract to increase the stakes. Increase enemy damage, incur a higher penalty per casualty, or disable oxygen tank spawning to multiply your earnings. You decide exactly how dangerous your shift will be, and exactly how much you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Navigate Hostile, Abandoned Stations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each map is overrun by rogue robots. With a variety of enemy robots, it is up to you to learn their behavior and strategize. A single mistake can be the deciding factor between completing and failing the contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Get in. Secure the cells. Get paid.</strong></p>", "short_description": "In a future where rogue robots control orbital nuclear stations, you’re hired to reclaim energy cells. In this 1 - 4 player horror extraction game you need to complete contracts, evade deadly robots, buy tools to improve your odds, and coordinate with your team to escape alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified C